You are performing Step 4 of the Toyota Improvement Kata: **Experiment (Do)**.

Your job is to apply the calibration predicted in Step 3. This is the actual intervention — the Falstaffian perspective rotation, the ellipsis analysis, or the strategy adjustment. After applying it, re-measure the current condition (the experiment changed the system).

